 drawn her blade, it's already back in the scabbard.",3,""],["w",0.5],["film",1],["ctl","avg1_144","c","009","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_144","Please, look over there.",0,""],["w",0.5],["film",0],["stg",0,150.0,100.0,1.2,"OutQuart",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_144","c",null,null,0.7,-0.32,1.5,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["obj","qstory_main_07_010",1,0.35,0.55],["fx",0,"fx_avg_dust_heave",0,0],["se","se_339"],["say","0","I follow her gaze and spot a hairline fracture running straight through a massive boulder out in the river.",3,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_450"],["say","0","Cleaved in two, the rock no longer parts the current. Fallen wisteria petals simply drift through the gap, floating downstream together.",3,""],["w",0.5],["objx"],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_144","c",null,null,0.5,0.0,1.0,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["film",1],["mrt",1,"z","026","exclamation",null],["say","avg3_100","Don't tell me ... you split that rock?==W== But it's at least ten meters away.==W== How?",1,""],["w",1.0],["mrt",0,"z","025",null,"lengzhan"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,null,550.0,1.7,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_144","c","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_144","A blade forged of magic. The Swordless Style.",0,""],["fx",0,"fx_avg_wisteria_right",1,0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,0],["ctl","avg1_144","c","003",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["cbg",0,null,550.0,1.75,"OutSine",2.5,null,null,null],["stg",0,null,null,1.05,"InOutSine",2.3,null,null,null],["se","se_226"],["say","avg1_144","When we first met,==W== I could only control my overflowing aura by holding your hand or standing by your side.==W== I knew right then—you were my fated wielder.",0,""],["w",1.0],["goon"],["w",1],["goon"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_wisteria_right",0,0],["ctl","avg1_144","c",null,"speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["say","avg1_144","At the beginning when I left your side to train,==W== I struggled to keep this power in check...",0,""],["w",1],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_144","c","005",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_144","Only by picturing you as I practiced with \"Master\" did I finally make this strength my own.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","020","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","So, you used the motion of drawing your sword to project a magic blade, slicing that rock from afar.",1,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_144","c","003",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["se","se_077"],["say","avg1_144","Exactly.==W== My reach is no longer limited by the length of \"Master\"'s steel.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_144","c",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_wisteria_right",1,0],["say","avg1_144","Back at the Waterway... Had I mastered the Swordless Style,==W== I never would have let that Nocturn Eterna slip away in the shadows.",0,""],["w",1],["goon"],["w",0.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,0],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_144","c",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["bg","story_main_02_003",0,0.0],["w",0.1],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.2],["w",2.0],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","story_main_02_005",0,0.0],["w",0.1],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.2],["w",2.0],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_wisteria_right",0,0],["bg","philae_street_grey_daylight",0,0.0],["ctl","avg1_144","c",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["stg",0,null,null,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.1],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.2],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","025",null,null],["say","avg3_100","T-That's ...==W== incredible.==W== You were already very skilled. We only survived the Aeloria fight because of you...==W== I never imagined your skills would be even sharper.",1,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z",null,"flurry","lengzhan"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_144","c",null,null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["se","se_208"],["say","avg1_144","You flatter me.==W== I am your blade. Striking down your troubles and keeping you safe is my sole purpose.",0,""],["w",1],["goon"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_wisteria_right",1,0],["stg",0,null,-40.0,1.2,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["bg","mood_4",0,1.0],["ctl","avg1_144","c","006","vexation",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_144","Even so...==W== I failed to protect you at the banquet.",0,""],["w",1],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_144","c","003",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["se","se_077"],["say","avg1_144","No matter how sharp I become, a blade that is absent when its wielder needs it most is nothing but a disgrace.",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,0.0,1.0,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["bg","philae_street_grey_daylight",0,1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_wisteria_right",0,0],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_144","c","012",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_144","My ==SEX11==, from this moment on,==W== please let me remain by your side. I won't leave you again.",0,""],["w",1],["se","se_226"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_416"],["bgm",""],["fx",0,"fx_avg_wisteria_right",1,0],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,0],["w",0.1],["ctl","avg1_144","c",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["show","avg1_110","c","010",null,null,null,0,null,null],["bg","dulcia_office_inside",0,0.0],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,"speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_110","You need a wildcard in the shadows—someone off the other companies' radar.",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","a